					"nextDialogs": [
						230250512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250512,
					"content": "That may be so. But why doesn't the sky fall? Why won't the earth collapse? Without accurate measurements, we'll never have answers to these questions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250513,
					"content": "In fact, I've come up with a model that explains these questions perfectly. I just need more observational data to support it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250514,
						230250515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250514,
					"content": "So, do you need my help?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250523,
					"content": "So you are willing to help, then? Many thanks to you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250524,
					"content": "Actually, I have ordered a customized set of beacons that will automatically collect the raw data necessary to support my deductions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250525,
					"content": "They need to be set up on high places such as cliffs and mountaintops for the raw data to stay free of the possible effects of terrains.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250526,
					"content": "But as you can see, I'm not much of a climber...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250527,
						230250529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250527,
					"content": "Leave it to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250528
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250528,
					"content": "Thank you! The sampling sites are nearby. Just let me know when you're done.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250529,
					"content": "You didn't take terrain into account when placing your order?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250530
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250530,
					"content": "Ahem... The sensitivity of the instrument was a priority, so the range of applications was naturally sacrificed...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250531,
					"content": "After all, the calculations could veer far off the mark even if we make only a small mistake. Anyways, I'm counting on you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Farghani"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250515,
					"content": "Good luck. See you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250516,
